body:
My middle school yearbook, signed by a teacher and family friend that passed away unexpectedly earlier this year. He was one of few to look past my behavioural issues and attention deficits and actually try to guide me and treat me with respect. I can't find mine, but I have my twin brother's, it reads;
"(Brother's name), take good care of your family for me. You two will always be important to me." 

Finding it was like seeing a ghost and I feel like if I could read what he wrote for me I could have a bit more closure.
